    "detailed_description": "The meditations are from various sources, such as Yoga, Taoism (Chi Kung and Tai Chi), and Zen. There are about 50 2-minute meditations and exercises, which are presented in intuitive order. This is a very soothing and calming mindfulness meditation that anyone can do.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are movement activities such as Qigong based on 8 Ba Gua Patterns as used in the I Ching.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYoga and slow walking are also activities in the app.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are various kinds of meditations for mindfulness of others, as well as taking time out for oneself and exploring one's inner spaces.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere is a section of 50 Physical and Spiritual Principles of the Universe to contemplate and think about.",
